\midrule
C1 & Qwen2.5-0.5B & 494M & WikiText-2 & \{0, 0.5, 1.0\} & 1 & QLoRA $r{=}16$ & 0.8 \\
C2 & Qwen2.5-1.5B & 1.5B & WikiText-2 & \{0, 0.1, \ldots, 1.0\} & 5 & QLoRA $r{=}16$ & 0.5 \\
